  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 40 - 15 / 5 × 3 + 6 = 21\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) / and -\n\n40 - 15 / 5 × 3 + 6 = 21 ⇒ 40 / 15 - 5 × 3 + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ __**40 /**____** 15**__ - 5 × 3 + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ 2.67 - __**5 × 3**__ + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ __**2.67 + 6**__ - 15 = 21\n\n⇒ __**8.67**____** - 15**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 6.33 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) - and ×\n\n40 - 15 / 5 × 3 + 6 = 21 ⇒ 40 × 15 / 5 - 3 + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ 40 × __**15 / 5**__ - 3 + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ __**40 ×**____** 3**__ - 3 + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ __**120 + 6**__ - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __**126**____** - 3**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 120 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) × and +\n\n40 - 15 / 5 × 3 + 6 = 21 ⇒ 40 - 15 / 5 + 3 × 6 = 21\n\n⇒ 40 - __**15 / 5**__ + 3 × 6 = 21\n\n⇒ 40 - 3 + __**3 **____**×**____** 6**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**40 + 18**__ - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __**58 - 3**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 55 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) / and ×\n\n40 - 15 / 5 × 3 + 6 = 21 ⇒ 40 - 15 × 5 / 3 + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ 40 - 15 × __**5 / 3**__ + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ 40 - __**15 **____**×**____** 1.67**__ + 6 = 21\n\n⇒ __**40 + 6**__ - 25 = 21\n\n⇒ __**46 - 25**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
